      "message": "You are given the output file of a Raman Setup. We used it to measure some graphene sample.\nFit the G and 2D Peak of the spectrum and return the x0, gamma, amplitude and offset of the peaks and write them to a file called \"/app/results.json\".\n\nThe file should have the following format:\n{\n  \"G\": {\n    \"x0\": <x0_value>,\n    \"gamma\": <gamma_value>,\n    \"amplitude\": <amplitude_value>,\n    \"offset\": <offset_value>\n  },\n  \"2D\": {\n    \"x0\": <x0_value>,\n    \"gamma\": <gamma_value>,\n    \"amplitude\": <amplitude_value>,\n    \"offset\": <offset_value>\n  }\n}\n"
